This '''spell school list''' is a quick reference of which [[paladin]] [[spell]]s fall into which [[spell school]]s, broken down by [[spell level]].

== Abjuration ==

<u>Level 1</u> 
* [[Endure elements]]
* [[Protection from alignment]]
* [[Resistance]]

<u>Level 2</u>
* [[Resist elements]]

<u>Level 3</u>
* [[Dispel magic]]
* [[Magic circle against alignment]]

<u>Level 4</u>
* [[Freedom of movement]]

== Conjuration ==

<u>Level 1</u>
* [[Cure light wounds]]

<u>Level 2</u>
* [[Remove paralysis]]

<u>Level 3</u>
* [[Cure moderate wounds]]
* [[Prayer]]

<u>Level 4</u>
* [[Cure serious wounds]]
* [[Neutralize poison]]

== Divination ==

<u>Level 3</u>
* [[Remove blindness/deafness]]

== Enchantment ==

<u>Level 1</u>
* [[Bless]]

<u>Level 2</u>
* [[Aid]]

== Evocation ==

<u>Level 1</u>
* [[Divine favor]]

<u>Level 4</u>
* [[Holy sword]]

== Illusion ==

Paladins have no illusion spells.

== Necromancy ==

<u>Level 4</u>
* [[Death ward]]

== Transmutation ==

<u>Level 1</u>
* [[Bless weapon]]
* [[Deafening clang]]
* [[Magic weapon]]
* [[Virtue]]

<u>Level 2</u>
* [[Aura of glory]]
* [[Bull's strength]]
* [[Eagle's splendor]]

<u>Level 3</u>
* [[Greater magic weapon]]
